stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle : Load Mission Dossier
    
    Idle --> Buffering : Initialize Replay Engine
    Buffering --> Ready : Assets Loaded & Milestone 0 Indexed
    
    Ready --> Playing : User Clicks Play
    Ready --> Scrubbing : User Drags Milestone Slider
    
    Playing --> Paused : User Clicks Pause
    Paused --> Playing : User Clicks Resume
    
    Playing --> AdvancingMilestone : Milestone Duration Elapsed
    AdvancingMilestone --> Playing : More Milestones Remaining
    AdvancingMilestone --> Completed : Final Milestone Concluded
    
    Completed --> Ready : User Clicks Reset / Replay
    Completed --> [*] : User Exits Mission Dossier
    
    Scrubbing --> Ready : User Releases Slider
    Playing --> Scrubbing : User Jumps to Landmark Milestone
